{"created": "2025-06-03T10:55:58.237446+00:00", "modified": "2025-06-03T10:55:59.002094+00:00", "id": 15537285, "conceptrecid": "15537284", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15537285", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.15537284", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15537285", "metadata": {"title": "INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Cathode GITT+EIS Structured Data", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15537285", "publication_date": "2025-05-28", "description": "<h1>Scope</h1>\n<p>This record contains galvanostatic intermittent titration technique (GITT) steps measured during electrochemical impedance spectra (EIS) on the NMC cathode of a commercial LG CHEM INR18650-MJ1 lithium-ion cell. The measurements were conducted at 25&deg;C and are provided in a structured Parquet format, suitable for data analysis workflows and model fitting.</p>\n<h2>Files</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Filename</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15537285/files/18650-LG-3500-MJ1-cathode-GITT-EIS-Ch.parquet\">18650-LG-3500-MJ1-cathode-GITT-EIS-Ch.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Structured GITT-EIS spectrum of NMC cathode during charge at 25&deg;C.</td>\n<td>application/parquet</td>\n<td>Use in data science pipelines or impedance modeling.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15537285/files/18650-LG-3500-MJ1-cathode-GITT-EIS-Dc.parquet\">18650-LG-3500-MJ1-cathode-GITT-EIS-Dc.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Structured GITT-EIS spectrum of NMC cathode during discharge at 25&deg;C.</td>\n<td>application/parquet</td>\n<td>Use in data science pipelines or impedance modeling.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>RDF Metadata</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Filename</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15537285/files/ro-crate-metadata.json\">ro-crate-metadata.json</a></td>\n<td>RDF metadata describing the data table schema, test, and battery</td>\n<td>application/json+ld</td>\n<td>Semantic Web integration</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15537285/files/ro-crate-preview.html\">ro-crate-preview.html</a></td>\n<td>RDF metadata describing the data table schema, test, and battery</td>\n<td>application/json+ld</td>\n<td>Semantic Web integration</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>Related Resources</h1>\n<table style=\"width: 100.025%; height: 607.6px;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.6px;\">\n<th style=\"width: 13.9874%; height: 19.6px;\">Relationship</th>\n<th style=\"width: 31.4716%; height: 19.6px;\">Name</th>\n<th style=\"width: 54.5319%; height: 19.6px;\">Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 333.2px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 13.9874%; height: 333.2px;\"><a href=\"https://schema.org/isPartOf\">isPartOf</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.4716%; height: 333.2px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/uploads/15537299\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Cathode Structured Data Collection</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.5319%; height: 333.2px;\">This collection contains records with structured data files representing GITT measurements on the positive electrode (cathode) harvested from an INR18650-MJ1 Li-ion battery cell. The active material in the electrode is NMC. The measurment is obtained in three-electrode configuration with the working electrode NMC, counter electrode composite graphite/silicon oxide, and reference electrode lithium metal in a coin cell casing. The records include raw data obtained from GITT and EIS measurements. The data is intended to be used to charactrize the open-circuit potential and lithium diffusion coefficient in the NMC material to support model-based analysis of MJ1 cells.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 117.6px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 13.9874%; height: 117.6px;\"><a href=\"https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.5/appendices/appendix-1/relationType/#continues\">Continues</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.4716%; height: 117.6px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15536942\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Cathode GITT+EIS Raw Data</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.5319%; height: 117.6px;\">This record contains the measurement results from a galvanostatic intermittent titration technique (GITT) test at 25&deg;C of an INR18650-MJ1 lithium-ion battery cell manufactured by LG CHEM. The raw data is provided in both HDF5 and CSV formats.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 78.4px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 13.9874%; height: 78.4px;\"><a href=\"https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.5/appendices/appendix-1/relationType/#continues\">Continues</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.4716%; height: 78.4px;\"><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15535240\">INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Cathode GITT+EIS Data Preprocessing</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.5319%; height: 78.4px;\">This record contains workflows for packaging GITT measurements of an INR18650-MJ1 battery cell manufactured by LG CHEM at 25&deg;C within Parquet files.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>Licensing</h1>\n<p>This dataset is licensed under CC-BY 4.0, allowing for sharing and adaptation with proper attribution.</p>\n<h1>Contact Information</h1>\n<p>For questions or further assistance, please contact Dennis Kopljar at dennis.kopljar@dlr.de.</p>\n<h1>References</h1>\n<p>This dataset is linked to the following publication: [DOI/Link to publication].</p>\n<h1>Notes</h1>\n<p>Legend for the dataset column names:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\"LINE\": # of the step in the measurement device script</li>\n<li>\"COMM\": type of the step (Charge/Discharge/...); intermittent EIS measurements happen during \"Set-Temp\", since the measurement device links with the climate chamber</li>\n<li>\"STATE\": labels start (3) and end (2) of any step</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Kuhn, Yannick", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0000-0002-9019-2290"}, {"name": "Rana, Bhawna", "affiliation": "German Aerospace Center", "orcid": "0000-0001-6403-5139"}, {"name": "Philipp, Micha", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0009-0002-8705-2059"}, {"name": "Schmitt, Christina", "affiliation": "German Aerospace Center", "orcid": "0000-0002-4095-7611"}, {"name": "Scipioni, Roberto", "affiliation": "SINTEF Energy Research", "orcid": "0000-0003-1926-421X"}, {"name": "Flores, Eibar", "affiliation": "SINTEF Industry", "orcid": "0000-0003-2954-1233"}, {"name": "Kopljar, Dennis", "affiliation": "German Aerospace Center", "orcid": "0000-0002-2228-2016"}, {"name": "Clark, Simon", "affiliation": "SINTEF Industry", "orcid": "0000-0002-8758-6109"}, {"name": "Latz, Arnulf", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0000-0003-1449-8172"}, {"name": "Horstmann, Birger", "affiliation": "Helmholtz Institute Ulm", "orcid": "0000-0002-1500-0578"}], "keywords": ["battery cell", "dataset", "eis", "gitt"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.6967238", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.15537299", "relation": "isPartOf", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.15536942", "relation": "continues", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.15535240", "relation": "continues", "resource_type": "workflow", "scheme": "doi"}], "version": "1.0.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "KW-BASF-6", "internal_id": "0281dp749::KW-BASF-6", "funder": {"name": "Helmholtz Association of German Research Centres"}}, {"code": "10110399", "internal_id": "019w4f821::10110399", "funder": {"name": "European Union"}}, {"code": "875527", "internal_id": "019w4f821::875527", "funder": {"name": "European Union"}}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "15537284"}}]}}, "title": "INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Cathode GITT+EIS St